	<http://sbols.org/v3#description> "Reverse terminator BBa_B0011 LuxICDABEG (+/-)" ;
	<http://parts.igem.org/#description> "LuxICDABEG (+/-) forms a stem-loop which cancels transcription on both strands, whichever you choose to place it in. Please see BBa_B0011 for details about the terminator." ;
